message: "If you use this software or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "School Management System: Design and Implementation for Fatima Academy, Nguru"
abstract: >-
  A desktop School Management System built in C# with a Microsoft Access
  database for Fatima Academy, Nguru, Yobe State, Nigeria. It supports staff
  and student registration, school fee records, and automatic computation of
  subject totals, grades and averages with role-based login access.
